{"title":"Quoting Paul Ford","link":"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Nov/5/paul-ford/","date":1793900043000,"content":"\n    <blockquote cite=\"https://ftrain.com/aboard-the-web-is-more-than-enough\"><p>The web browser is very, very, very powerful software for applications, <em>and the cost of accessing that power is going down seemingly every day</em>.</p></blockquote>\n<p>— <a href=\"https://ftrain.com/aboard-the-web-is-more-than-enough\">Paul Ford</a>, The Web Is More Than Enough</p>\n\n    <p>Tags: <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/browsers\">browsers</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/paul-ford\">paul-ford</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/web-development\">web-development</a></p>\n\n\n\n","author":"Simon Willison","siteTitle":"Simon Willison’s Weblog","siteHash":"1b599216bd27a00f15d67a3ed9719c64148630c70244b6dd8e743f17cb45527e","entryHash":"d87af02d2799f518de84eea3434fb2898d5d738496fa6cfdcc9e0a70305dabf8","category":"Tech"}